  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Medieval_Buildings_Nether_Edition/BH_MBNE_header.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"450\"></strong></a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">深入「中世紀建築」的世界，體驗這令人興奮的下界版本。探索五座壯觀的中世紀風格建築，從熾熱的下界景觀中拔地而起。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">非常適合冒險者，每座建築都藏有豐富的寶藏、巧妙的陷阱與強敵。準備好在這灼熱之地迎接一場難忘的挑戰吧！</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">完美相容於各大下界生物群落模組，包括：Biomes O' Plenty、Regions Unexplored、Better Nether、Incendium、Gardens of the Dead 以及更多！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">別忘了下載「中世紀建築」主版本！ <strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/medieval-buildings\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">點擊這裡！</span></a></strong><br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">終界（END）版本也已推出！&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/medieval-buildings-end-edition\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">點擊這裡！</span></a></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>需要伺服器才能和朋友一起遊玩嗎？</strong></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Medieval_Buildings_Nether_Edition/BH_MBNE_promo.webp\" width=\"1401\" height=\"251\"></strong></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">如果您正在尋找能與朋友暢玩任意模組或整合包的伺服器，<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Bisect Hosting</strong></a> 就是您的最佳解方！他們提供 Minecraft 業界極具競爭力的價格與品質，只要點擊<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fLupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>此連結</strong></a>並輸入優惠碼「Lupin」，即可享有 25% 折扣。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Medieval_Buildings_Nether_Edition/BH_MBNE_summary.webp\" width=\"1398\" height=\"151\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">本模組為下界增添了五座獨特的建築，每座皆以精美的中世紀風格精心打造，能與您的遊戲世界完美融合。最重要的是，它完全相容於多數修改下界生成的模組！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">若您熱愛探索建築、欣賞壯闊的工程，或是被古時代的神秘氛圍所吸引，本模組絕對能為您的冒險增添色彩。趕快將它加入您的整合包，暢遊嶄新的下界建築群吧！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif;font-size:18px\">所有建築皆由：&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/emberunholy/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">emberunholy</a>&nbsp;設計</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', sans-serif;font-size:18px\">需要安裝 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cloth Config API</a>。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Medieval_Buildings_Nether_Edition/BH_MBNE_faq.webp\" width=\"1398\" height=\"151\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>與其他添加建築的模組相容嗎？</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\">毫無疑問，它可與任何模組完美相容，無論是用來增加建築或生物群落的模組皆可。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>可以在哪裡找到這些新建築？</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">僅限於下界。它們會依照特定參數隨機生成，確保不會過於密集。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>支援伺服器環境嗎？</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\">當然！運作完全正常！記得與好友暢玩模組的最佳選擇就是 Bisect Hosting，只要 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252flupin\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>點擊此連結即可享有 25% 折扣</strong></a>。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>本模組可以加入整合包使用嗎？</strong></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">當然可以！前提是僅限於在 Modrinth 或 CurseForge 上發布。若上傳至其他平台將違反我們的授權規定，一律不允許。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">不過，若您願意將本模組納入您的 Modrinth 或 CurseForge 整合包，我們將深感榮幸。若有任何調整需求或疑問，歡迎隨時與我們聯繫！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif\"><strong>我可以錄製本模組的實況影片並在個人頻道發布嗎？</strong></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">當然可以！您完全可以在您的頻道遊玩本模組或我們的任何整合包並製作相關影片，事實上，我們非常樂見並感謝您的分享！</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Medieval_Buildings_Nether_Edition/BH_MBNE_screenshots.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1398\" height=\"151\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1207/759/medieval-buildings-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"><br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1207/764/medieval-buildings-6.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1207/772/medieval-buildings-11.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1207/773/medieval-buildings-12.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1207/774/medieval-buildings-13.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:18px\"><strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/X8VY5WMbe4\" rel=\"nofollow\">